Subject: [PATCH] goodixqsee: include the response parser declaration

The transport calls goodix_qsee_parse_response_status(), declared by the
protocol header. Include that declaration so the full all-driver build
succeeds with implicit function declarations treated as errors.

--- a/libfprint/drivers/goodixqsee/goodix-qsee-transport.c
+++ b/libfprint/drivers/goodixqsee/goodix-qsee-transport.c
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
 /* SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later */
 #include "goodix-qsee-transport.h"
+#include "goodix-qsee-proto.h"
 
 #include <errno.h>
 #include <fcntl.h>
